==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{adv|Jirachi}} grants [[Archie]]'s wish, and a monster {{p|Kyogre}} appears by the {{gdis|Battle Frontier|III}}.
* {{adv|Gold}} and {{adv|Crystal}} appear.
* The non-petrified [[Pokédex holder]]s battle Archie.
* {{adv|Emerald}} tries to make Jirachi grant his own wish. This, however, fails.
* Emerald's past is revealed.
* Emerald is revealed to be the child that asked {{adv|Professor Oak}} for a Pokédex in ''[[PS180|The Last Battle XIV]]''.
* {{adv|Ruby}}'s [[Mumu]], {{adv|Sapphire}}'s [[Chic]], and [[Emerald's Sceptile]] learn the Ultimate Moves.
* Jirachi grants Emerald's wish.
* The petrified Pokédex holders are freed.
* The Battle Frontier is flooded by the monster Kyogre.
* {{adv|Silver}}'s [[Silver's Feraligatr|Feraligatr]] masters {{m|Hydro Cannon}}.
* The monster Kyogre is destroyed by the ten Pokédex holders.
* The secret behind Archie's armor and sword is revealed, after which he disappears.
* The Pokédex holders arrange a competition in the [[Battle Dome]].
* Professor Oak asks [[Todd Snap]] to take pictures on an [[Pokémon Island|island]] that only Pokémon are known to inhabit.
* Jirachi returns to its millennium-long sleep.
* Crystal and Professor Oak call [[Professor Rowan]].

